1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
SignalProof is an ECG artifact research lab, not a diagnostic tool.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:11,500
It helps students compare a trained one-dimensional convolutional
neural network with a spectral logistic regression baseline.

3
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:16,500
Start in Signal lab. Each example is eight seconds at 128 hertz.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,300
Both trained models run locally, without a model API, paid service, or
patient upload.

5
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:29,100
Their outputs are artifact signatures. Reference does not mean a
normal rhythm or a clinically usable signal.

6
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:33,899
Here I select an electrode-motion example and compare the
probabilities.

7
00:00:33,899 --> 00:00:40,700
An exploratory abstention threshold makes low confidence visible, but
it is not a validated safety guarantee.

8
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:48,000
I can save the signal, predictions and a research note to the local
notebook, then export a backup.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,500
Stress bench adds controlled digital perturbations. This is a before-
and-after comparison, not a new ground-truth quality label.

10
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:04,799
Evidence shows the full protocol. Reference records are split before
generating examples. Noise comes from separate time blocks.

11
00:01:04,799 --> 00:01:15,700
On 1,800 held-out windows from three unseen reference records, the CNN
achieves 50.8% accuracy and a macro F1 of 0.485.

12
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:25,900
The baseline reaches 46.6% and 0.411. The CNN has worse log loss, so
deep learning does not win every metric.

13
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:31,500
Error explorer keeps incorrect predictions visible, with record
offsets and injection settings.

14
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:37,799
The limits matter: artificial labels, just eleven reference records,
and three shared noise sources.

15
00:01:37,799 --> 00:01:46,959
SignalProof makes those limits part of the product, alongside
reproducible training, real browser inference, tests and a detailed
interview manual.
